        ]
      },
      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "El Sol vivía del otro lado del cielo. Pero su hija vivía justo en el medio del cielo.",
          "en": "The Sun lived on the far side of the sky. But her daughter lived right in the middle of the sky."
        },
        {
          "es": "Cada día, al cruzar el cielo, el Sol paraba a cenar en la casa de su hija.",
          "en": "Every day, as the Sun crossed the sky, she stopped at her daughter's house for dinner."
        },
        {
          "es": "Pero al Sol no le gustaba la gente de la tierra. Siempre entrecerraban los ojos al mirarla.",
          "en": "But the Sun did not like the people on the earth. They always squinted when they looked at her."
        },
        {
          "es": "'Mis nietos son feos', le dijo a su hermano. 'Me ponen caras raras.'",
          "en": "'My grandchildren are ugly,' she told her brother. 'They screw up their faces at me.'"
        },
        {
          "es": "Pero la Luna dijo: 'A mí me gustan. Siempre me sonríen, porque mi luz es suave.'",
          "en": "But the Moon said, 'I like them. They always smile at me, because my light is soft.'"
        }
      ],
