        ]
      },
      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Los Hombrecitos dijeron: 'Traigan a su hija del País de los Espíritus, en la Tierra Oscura del oeste.'",
          "en": "The Little Men said, 'Bring back her daughter from the Ghost Country, in the Darkening Land in the west.'"
        },
        {
          "es": "Salieron siete hombres. Cada uno llevaba una varita corta de madera, y llevaban una caja.",
          "en": "Seven men set out. Each one carried a short rod of sourwood, and they took a box."
        },
        {
          "es": "'Cuando la encuentren, pónganla en la caja', dijeron. 'Y no la abran hasta llegar a casa.'",
          "en": "'When you find her, put her in the box,' said the Little Men. 'And never open it until you are home.'"
        }
      ],
      "actores": [
        {
          "id": "hombrecito",
          "como": "cherokee",
