      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "A los siete días llegaron a la Tierra Oscura. Los espíritus estaban bailando, como en casa.",
          "en": "After seven days, they reached the Darkening Land. The ghosts were having a dance, just like at home."
        },
        {
          "es": "Cuando la joven pasó bailando, un hombre la tocó con su varita. Después otro, y otro.",
          "en": "When the young woman danced past, one man touched her with his rod. Then another, and another."
        },
        {
          "es": "Al séptimo toque, cayó fuera de la ronda. La pusieron en la caja y cerraron la tapa.",
          "en": "At the seventh touch, she fell out of the circle. They put her in the box and closed the lid."
        }
      ],
